Convert one piece of residue from the Java mod (namespace 'examplemod') to Bedrock.

Kind: recipe
Source: data/examplemod/recipes/steel_block.json

The deterministic converter refused it because:
- ingredient uses tag 'c:ingots/steel', which covers more than one item

Source file data/examplemod/recipes/steel_block.json:
```
{
  "type": "minecraft:crafting_shapeless",
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "tag": "c:ingots/steel"
    }
  ],
  "result": {
    "item": "examplemod:steel_block"
  }
}

```

